sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client
    participant B as Bank Agent (leader)
    participant I as Informations Agent
    participant A as Actions Agent

    C->>B: Question needing a sub-agent
    Note over B: Model calls ask_*_agent<br/>src/agent/tools/remoteAgents.ts:32 / :57
    Note over I,A: Shown with the Informations Agent, same cases for the Actions Agent

    alt Agent Card unreachable (agent down)
        B--xI: GET /.well-known/agent-card.json
        Note over B: Client not cached, next call retries discovery<br/>src/a2a/remoteAgent.ts:121
    else Network error or timeout (100 s)
        B--xI: SendMessage
    else Task rejected (e.g. missing client_id)
        B->>I: SendMessage
        I-->>B: Task rejected + reason
    else Task failed (sub-agent LLM error or timeout)
        B->>I: SendMessage
        I-->>B: Task failed + generic message<br/>informations_agent/executor.py:105
    end

    Note over B: Error returned to the model as a tool error,<br/>the turn does not fail<br/>src/agent/tools/remoteAgents.ts:95
    B-->>C: Apology + alternatives (app, phone line)
